title: $:/mf/gen/CLI command/mf watch activity
catalog: CLI command
target: mf watch activity
summary: How many watcher events arrived under a directory since the load, and under which of its children — walk down from / to find the noise

!! Reference

```
How many watcher events arrived under a directory since the load, and under which of its children — walk down from / to find the noise

Usage: mf watch activity [OPTIONS] [PATH]

Arguments:
  [PATH]
          Directory (absolute filesystem path, or repo-root-relative with a leading slash); the repository root when omitted

Options:
      --limit <LIMIT>
          How many children to list
          
          [default: 20]

      --reset
          Forget every count and start again

      --json
          Print the raw JSON response body

  -h, --help
          Print help
```
